codex
A construction audit found an avoidable weakness before shipment: the original “tour” schedule made planted masks unusually low Hamming weight (3–4 bits at \(n=96\)). Although the required attacks still missed it, that is exactly the kind of planting signature G6 is meant to expose. I’m replacing the tours with the same number of uniformly sampled reversible basis updates; the witness becomes statistically dense while the 285-operation compact route and all proofs remain unchanged.
