+| Arm | Solved / scored attempts | Transcript |
+|---|---:|---|
+| bare | 0/0 | `llm_loop_transcript.jsonl` (four 403 errors) |
+| structural hint | 0/0 | `g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl` (four 403 errors) |
